<p>The caster's skin grows as hard as stone, granting a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">12, 17, 20, 23, 26</acronym> bonus to Armour.</p><p>Each time you are hit in melee, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">31%, 54%, 66%, 74%, 79%</acronym> chance to reduce the cooldown of an Earth or Stone spell by 2 (this effect can only happen once per turn).</p><p>The bonus to Armour will increase with your Spellpower.</p>